  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Blind Cats See a Future!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blind Cat Rescue &amp; Sanctuary is a loving and permanent home to cats who don&apos;t have a future.  Blind cats are considered unadoptable and euthanized in most shelters before they ever get a chance for a home.  Since opening in 2005, we&apos;ve been that chance for these cats, offering them a forever home and making sure they are never abandoned, hungry or frightened again. In 2011, we opened our doors and hearts to cats who test positive for FIV and feline leukemia, offering them the same safe forever.</narrative>
  </description>
